{"2700900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toska", "steam_appid": 2700900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700900/extras/5fdd94d023d443aa654a819678560b88.poster.avif?t=1784164606\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700900/extras/5fdd94d023d443aa654a819678560b88.webm?t=1784164606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2700900/extras/5fdd94d023d443aa654a819678560b88.mp4?t=1784164606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Something is wrong with this town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Toska</i> is an atmospheric 2D exploration game spanning five days. Each day presents a limited window during your trip home from school to explore, discover hidden secrets, meet interesting characters, and bring home something nice for your mom. Will you spend your afternoons helping others and finding the perfect gift for your mom? Or will curiosity lead you somewhere you were never meant to go? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned houses and structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet quirky characters and help or hinder them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read people's mail</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together a larger mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find gifts your mom will love</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse